  "description": "Tarpey Maloney Properties are delighted to present to the rental market this newly refurbished 3-bedroom home in Woodfield, Cappagh Road, Galway.\n\nThis bright and modern property has been fully upgraded throughout, featuring a new zoned heating system, condensing oil boiler, hot water cylinder, new bathroom, new kitchen with tiling, newly carpeted bedrooms, and triple-glazed windows. The property has a BER rating of B2.\n\nThe house is offered unfurnished but includes brand-new kitchen appliances: washing machine, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, and hob.\nGround Floor:\n•\tTimber-floored sitting room\n•\tSpacious kitchen/dining area with sliding doors leading to a low-maintenance rear garden and brick shed\n•\tUnder-stairs storage area\nFirst Floor:\n•\tNewly fitted bathroom with electric shower\n•\tTwo large double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n•\tOne single bedroom with built-in wardrobe\n•\tLarge hot press\nLocation:\nWoodfield is a quiet and well-maintained estate just off the Cappagh Road. The property is within walking distance of Cappagh Park and Barna Woods, and close to Silver Strand and Rusheen Bay. A range of primary and secondary schools, as well as Gateway Retail Park and Tesco Shopping Centre, are also nearby.\n\nThere is parking for two cars in the driveway.\n\nPlease note:\nOnly careful tenants with excellent references will be considered.\nTo apply, please submit your interest via the Daft.ie website to receive an application form.\nDue to the high volume of enquiries, not all emails can be responded to individually.",
